{
  ".env.example": "# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n",
  ".gitignore": "node_modules/\nbuild/\ndist/\ncoverage/\n.DS_Store\n*.log\n.env*\n!.env.example\n",
  "README.md": "# ProfileRewards - Web Traffic & Profile Exchange Web Application\n\nProfileRewards is a modern, responsive, high-performance web platform built with React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and Firebase Firestore/Auth.\n\n## ðŸš€ Features\n\n- **Profile Ranking System**: Dynamic profile leaderboard ordered strictly by Profile Level (#1 Crown, #2 Trophy, #3 Medal).\n- **Web Traffic Exchange Hub**: 15-second timed visits with automatic countdown, tab session verification, and instant coin/level point rewards.\n- **Earn Rewards Hub**: Daily rewards, lucky wheel spin, scratch cards, and achievement quests that directly boost profile levels and rank.\n- **Firebase Firestore Real-time Sync**: Live synchronization of user profiles, points, promoted links, transactions, and level XP.\n- **Withdrawal & Coin Management**: Coin to BDT withdrawal requests, transaction history, and custom promo links.\n\n---\n\n## ðŸ’» Local Setup & Development\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n### 2. Run the Development Server\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n```\nOpen your browser at `http://localhost:3000` (or `http://localhost:5173`).\n\n### 3. Build for Production\n```bash\nnpm run build\n```\n\n---\n\n## ðŸ“¦ GitHub Deployment\n\n```bash\ngit init\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"Initial commit - ProfileRewards Complete App\"\ngit branch -M main\ngit remote add origin YOUR_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL\ngit push -u origin main\n```\n",
  "assets/.aistudio/.gitignore": "*\n",
